<title>USA: TransTexas Gas completes Mississippi well.</title>
<headline>TransTexas Gas completes Mississippi well.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransTexas Gas Corp said on Monday it has completed drilling a second natural gas well in Wayne County, Miss. and will flow-test it by early February.</p>
<p>The first well in this area tested at 12.4 million cubic feet of natural gas and 440 barrels of condensate per day. A third well is now being drilled.  TransTexas owns a 94 percent working interest in the 6,750-gross-acre area.</p>
</text>
